  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nx = √45 + √5\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\n(a + b)² = a² + 2ab + b²\n\n√m × √n = √(m × n)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ x² = (√45 + √5)²\n\n⇒ x² = (√45)² + 2 × √45 × √5 + (√5)²\n\n⇒ x\n² = 45 + 2 × √(45 × 5) + 5\n\n⇒ x² = 45 + 2 × √225 + 5\n\n⇒ x² = 45 + 2 × 15 + 5\n\n⇒ x² = 45 + 30 + 5\n\n⇒ x² = 80\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 80.**",
